WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:07.923
The rookies were in the kitchen.

2
00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:11.340
They wanted to make a special dish.

3
00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:15.248
"I can't wait for Space Feast," Lucy said.

4
00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:18.713
"It's the best feast of the year!"

5
00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:21.120
Ringo looked at Rosco.

6
00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.779
"Thanks for letting us cook here."

7
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:31.596
"You're welcome," Rosco said.

8
00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:39.398
Bot found a recipe.

9
00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:45.714
PJ found cooking videos.

10
00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:48.923
Ringo and Lucy started cooking.

11
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:52.845
"Our dish will be the best," Lucy said.

12
00:00:52.846 --> 00:00:55.516
Ringo chopped some comet carrots.

13
00:00:55.517 --> 00:00:57.776
"Maybe," he said.

14
00:00:57.777 --> 00:01:01.208
"But everybody brings something good."

15
00:01:01.209 --> 00:01:05.642
"Captain Nova is cooking something too," Lucy said.

16
00:01:05.643 --> 00:01:09.026
"I hope it has boomberrries."

17
00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:13.786
Ringo patted his belly. "I'm so hungry.

18
00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:16.413
I'm going to eat everything!"

19
00:01:16.414 --> 00:01:20.863
Lucy laughed.

20
00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:23.560
"It won't make you any bigger!

21
00:01:23.561 --> 00:01:27.211
You'll still be tiny."

22
00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:29.290
Ringo frowned.

23
00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:32.148
"Don't worry," Rosco said.

24
00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:35.143
"There will be lots of food.

25
00:01:35.144 --> 00:01:38.438
You can eat as much as you want."

26
00:01:38.439 --> 00:01:42.133
"I can't wait!" Ringo said.

27
00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:47.083
Crackle! Captain Nova's voice came over a speaker.

28
00:01:47.084 --> 00:01:52.022
"Ringo, Lucy. Report to my office. Now!"

29
00:01:52.023 --> 00:01:55.325
"Oh no!" Lucy said.

30
00:01:55.326 --> 00:02:00.445
Ringo groaned. "It's a new mission.

31
00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:05.930
What if we miss the feast?"

